WEBVTT

00:08:28.921 --> 00:08:31.006
but they can apply to sex.

00:08:31.799 --> 00:08:34.677
I truly think that the strategy

00:08:34.677 --> 00:08:38.264
to raising adults
with healthy sexual behaviors

00:08:38.305 --> 00:08:41.267
is to first teach kids about consent,

00:08:41.308 --> 00:08:42.643
like, super early,

00:08:42.643 --> 00:08:45.729
way before sex is even a topic
of conversation.

00:08:46.605 --> 00:08:49.066
Can you imagine
having conversations with kids

00:08:49.108 --> 00:08:53.571
and letting them know that everything
about their bodies can be negotiated?

00:08:53.571 --> 00:08:54.738
For example,

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:58.534
let them decide who they want
to help them during bath time.

00:08:59.118 --> 00:09:00.494
Or tell them